<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Science | Amic Biotech</title>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#f4f8fd;
color:#222;
}

.hero{
padding:90px 10%;
}

.container{
max-width:1200px;
margin:auto;
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
gap:70px;
align-items:center;
}

.text h1{
font-size:60px;
color:#1565c0;
margin-bottom:25px;
}

.text p{
font-size:20px;
line-height:1.8;
margin-bottom:22px;
color:#555;
}

.text strong{
color:#1565c0;
}

.image img{
width:100%;
border-radius:24px;
box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
}

.info{
max-width:1200px;
margin:70px auto;
padding:0 10%;
}

.info h2{
font-size:42px;
color:#1565c0;
margin-bottom:25px;
}

.info p{
font-size:19px;
line-height:1.9;
color:#555;
margin-bottom:25px;
}

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));
gap:30px;
margin-top:50px;
}

.card{
background:white;
padding:30px;
border-radius:18px;
box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
transition:.3s;
}

.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-8px);
}

.card h3{
color:#1565c0;
margin-bottom:15px;
font-size:24px;
}

.card p{
font-size:17px;
color:#666;
line-height:1.7;
}

.footer{
margin-top:80px;
padding:50px;
text-align:center;
background:#1565c0;
color:white;
}

@media(max-width:900px){

.container{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

.text h1{
font-size:42px;
}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<section class="hero">

<div class="container">

<div class="text">

<h1>The Science Behind Nutrition</h1>

<p>
At <strong>Amic Biotech</strong>, we believe that science is the foundation of better health. Our goal is to develop high-quality nutritional supplements using scientific research, modern biotechnology, and responsible innovation.
</p>

<p>
A healthy and balanced diet is the primary source of vitamins and minerals. However, some people may not always get enough nutrients because of their diet, age, lifestyle, or other individual factors. In these situations, dietary supplements may help increase nutrient intake when used appropriately.
</p>

<p>
Our products are designed to complement a healthy lifestyle and are not intended to replace a balanced diet or professional medical advice.
</p>

</div>

<div class="image">

<img src="/images/hero.png" alt="Science">

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="info">

<h2>Why Vitamins Matter</h2>

<p>
Vitamins and minerals are essential nutrients that support many normal functions of the human body. They contribute to immune function, energy metabolism, bone health, muscle function, and many other biological processes.
</p>

<p>
At Amic Biotech, we are committed to selecting quality ingredients and following scientific principles throughout research, development, and manufacturing. We believe transparency, quality, and continuous innovation are key to building products people can trust.
</p>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<h3>🛡️ Immune Support</h3>
<p>
Certain vitamins and minerals contribute to the normal function of the immune system as part of a balanced diet.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>⚡ Energy</h3>
<p>
B vitamins help support normal energy-yielding metabolism and contribute to reducing tiredness and fatigue.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🦴 Bone Health</h3>
<p>
Vitamin D and calcium contribute to the maintenance of normal bones when consumed in adequate amounts.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>❤️ Heart & Brain</h3>
<p>
Omega-3 fatty acids are important nutrients that play a role in normal heart function and brain health.
</p>
</div>

</div>

